[[Burning Titan]]s are powerful [[titan]]s found roaming the later parts of the game. They are not that big of a threat in direct damage done, but people in adjacent range will be given the [[Burning]] condition. They are susceptible to [[cold damage]], and when killed, they will each spawn a [[Risen Ashen Hulk]].

